			title: "&6The Tools You Cannot Skip"
			x: -15.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6F928CDC354ECCAA"]
			description: [
				"Three copper, one tin. The first alloy, and the entire steam age is built from it."
				""
				"&7Chalcopyrite gives copper, cassiterite gives tin. Both come out of your deepslate sieve.&r"
				""
				"&e&lMix the dusts, then smelt.&r A crucible or furnace works now; the Alloy Smelter does it properly in a moment."
				""
				"&8You need a lot. Every steam machine, every casing, every pipe at this tier is bronze.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:bronze_ingot"
			id: "6DA8E644C8768590"
			rewards: [{
				id: "48A3D554B7118902"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Copper plus tin"
			tasks: [{
				count: 16L
				id: "31DDC11453A7D561"
				item: "gtceu:bronze_ingot"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&6Bronze"
			x: -13.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"The &eSteam Solid Boiler&r burns fuel to boil water into steam. That steam is your first power."
				""
				"&c&lIt needs water and it will explode without it.&r Keep it fed. A boiler that runs dry while hot destroys itself and a good deal of what is next to it."
				""
				"&7Steam travels in pipes to steam machines. It is not FE and nothing else in your base can use it.&r"
				""
				"&8There is a Solar Boiler if you would rather not babysit fuel. It is slower, and it is much harder to blow up.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lp_steam_solid_boiler"
			id: "4A29E20A07C9F89F"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7167937794CF449B"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Water in, steam out, do not forget the water"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1BC7354E5E648706"
				item: "gtceu:lp_steam_solid_boiler"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&6Steam, The Hard Way"
			x: -12.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&e&lThis is the machine that pays for GregTech.&r"
				""
				"One raw ore in, two dust out. Everything you sieve is now worth double, and dust is what every downstream process actually wants."
				""
				"&7If you build one steam machine, build this one. Ore doubling from the first tier is the reason the grind is bearable.&r"
				""
				"&8Later tiers add washing and centrifuging on top, taking one ore to three or four dust plus byproducts.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lp_steam_macerator"
			id: "62BB32BBB7EADB8A"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "01CA1FAFA7F74775"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 60
				}
				{
					id: "24E93594B5B55A98"
					type: "random"
				}
			]
			subtitle: "&7Ore doubling, from tier one"
			tasks: [{
				id: "58FFAD2CEEE288D1"
				item: "gtceu:lp_steam_macerator"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&6The Macerator"
			x: -10.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["62BB32BBB7EADB8A"]
			description: [
				"Five more machines that between them cover everything the steam age can do."
				""
				"&eFurnace&r smelts. &eAlloy Smelter&r combines two inputs into an alloy - this is how you stop hand-mixing bronze. &eCompressor&r makes blocks and plates. &eExtractor&r pulls fluids out of things. &eForge Hammer&r flattens ingots into plates."
				""
				"&7Plates are the hidden tax of GregTech - almost every recipe wants them. Get the Forge Hammer running early.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lp_steam_alloy_smelter"
			id: "13C3AE5E4E227AE3"
			rewards: [{
				id: "02A4F43D4811003E"
