		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"702DDE04AD6FE445"
				"3CF8A5492C9EB3DB"
			]
			description: [
				"&6&lThe most important multiblock in GregTech.&r"
				""
				"A 3x3x4 shell of heatproof casings around &eCupronickel Coils&r, with energy, item and fluid hatches. It smelts what nothing else can."
				""
				"&e&lCoils set the temperature and temperature gates materials.&r Cupronickel reaches 1800K - enough for aluminium and stainless steel. Kanthal, Nichrome and beyond come later and unlock the metals above them."
				""
				"&7Every tier from here to the end of the chapter is gated on a hotter coil. When a recipe says it needs a temperature you cannot reach, the answer is always better coils.&r"
				""
				"&8It also replaces the Primitive Blast Furnace for steel, at roughly twenty times the speed.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:electric_blast_furnace"
			id: "69C6C815EF744A38"
			rewards: [
