			x: 1.5d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"128 EU/t. Four times LV, and the tier where GregTech starts feeling fast."
				""
				"&7Aluminium hulls, MV circuits, MV components. The same machines you already have, rebuilt one tier up - and every one of them now overclocks off LV recipes.&r"
				""
				"&e&lAn MV machine running an LV recipe runs at four times the speed for four times the power.&r That is what a voltage tier actually buys you.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:mv_machine_hull"
