			x: 3.0d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["35C0E27B8CC84BB1"]
			description: [
				"A &eDistillery&r splits one fluid into one product. A &eDistillation Tower&r splits it into all of them at once."
				""
				"&7The tower is a tall multiblock - one output hatch per layer, each catching a different fraction. Oil into naphtha, diesel, kerosene, refinery gas and more.&r"
				""
				"&e&lThis is where GregTech's oil chain overtakes PneumaticCraft's&r - same crude, far more products, and every one of them feeds a chemistry line.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:distillation_tower"
