		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0CBF1A9A4A2396CA"]
			description: [
				"The second coil tier - 2700K, up from cupronickel's 1800K."
				""
				"&7Swap them into your Electric Blast Furnace and a whole set of recipes that were previously impossible becomes routine. Titanium in particular needs the heat.&r"
				""
				"&8Coil upgrades are the cleanest progression markers in the mod. When in doubt, get hotter.&r"
			]
