		{
			dependencies: ["0CBF1A9A4A2396CA"]
			description: [
				"512 EU/t, stainless hulls, and the tier where multiblocks start to dominate."
				""
				"&7Single-block machines still work, but from HV on the interesting recipes increasingly want a multiblock - and multiblocks scale in a way single blocks cannot.&r"
