		{
			description: [
				"&6&lHot ingots have to be cooled before they are usable, and only this machine can do it.&r"
				""
				"The Electric Blast Furnace produces &eHot Ingots&r for the high-temperature metals. A hot ingot is not an ingot - you cannot craft with it until it is frozen."
				""
				"&7Titanium, tungsten steel and everything above them pass through here. It is a hard gate and there is no way around it.&r"
				""
				"&8It also makes liquid nitrogen and liquid helium, both of which matter for the tiers above.&r"
			]
