		{
			description: [
				"The single-block chemical reactor with the throughput limits removed."
				""
				"&7Perfect efficiency, no overclock penalty, and it handles recipes the small one refuses outright. Every serious chemistry chain from HV onward runs through one.&r"
				""
				"&8Small, cheap for a multiblock, and one of the best value builds in the mod.&r"
			]
