		{
			description: [
				"Compresses things by detonating explosives next to them. Genuinely."
				""
				"&7It is how you make diamonds from carbon, and how several dense alloys are formed. Feed it TNT or, better, dynamite.&r"
				""
				"&8Loud. Put it somewhere you do not mind hearing.&r"
