		{
			description: [
				"A multiblock diesel engine. Feed it a good fuel and lubricant and it produces HV power continuously."
				""
				"&7Your distillation tower makes the fuel; the chemistry line makes the lubricant. This is the first generator that comfortably outruns your consumption.&r"
				""
				"&e&lRun it with oxygen&r for a substantial boost, at the cost of needing an oxygen supply.&r"
				""
				"&8Alternatively, keep converting FE from the rest of your base. Both are valid; the engine is more in the spirit of the thing.&r"
			]
