				""
				"&7This is where circuit production stops being a recipe and becomes a factory: grow silicon boules, slice them into wafers, engrave the wafers, cut them into chips, assemble the chips into circuits.&r"
				""
				"&e&lIf your circuit assembler line is not automated by now, it will become the thing that stops you.&r"
