		{
			dependencies: ["488ED1E4259C425B"]
			description: [
				"Tungsten and steel at 3000K, then frozen. The IV casing metal."
				""
				"&7Scheelite and tungstate from the netherrack sieve give tungsten. Both are rare drops - this is the point where sieve throughput becomes the bottleneck rather than power.&r"
				""
				"&8Tungsten steel is also what the Assembly Line is made of, so budget generously.&r"
