				{
					id: "1195C530B3DC99AC"
					item: "gtceu:lv_energy_input_hatch"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "&eHatches and Buses"
			x: 1.5d
			y: 5.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Multiblocks need a &eMaintenance Hatch&r, and occasionally they need attention through it."
				""
				"&7When a problem appears, open the hatch and apply the tool it asks for - wrench, screwdriver, hammer, wire cutter or crowbar. Ignore it and the machine runs slower.&r"
				""
				"&8An Auto-Maintenance Hatch removes the chore permanently and is worth building the moment you can.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:maintenance_hatch"
			id: "17667FE3DE3D3593"
			rewards: [{
				id: "4727083ECAEAF67F"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 40
			}]
			subtitle: "&7The chore you can automate away"
			tasks: [{
				id: "08F1DA0480A14E20"
				item: "gtceu:maintenance_hatch"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&eMaintenance"
			x: 3.0d
			y: 5.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["13C3AE5E4E227AE3"]
			description: [
				"A &eMiner&r digs an area beneath it automatically. A &eRock Crusher&r turns cobble into gravel, sand and dust."
				""
				"&7On a skyblock the miner has nothing to dig, so it is mostly a curiosity here - but the Rock Crusher is genuinely useful for turning your cobble surplus into sieve feedstock.&r"
				""
				"&8Cobblestone into gravel into sand into dust is a legitimate ore-adjacent chain when you have a cobble generator.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lp_steam_rock_crusher"
			id: "2BFBF2B5FB241A7B"
			rewards: [{
				id: "25B7102D231EA9EF"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 40
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Cobble into feedstock"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "0121A1CA535F41B2"
					item: "gtceu:lp_steam_miner"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "4F904A3D7FAF0274"
					item: "gtceu:lp_steam_rock_crusher"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "&6Steam Miner"
			x: -9.0d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"A multiblock boiler that produces far more steam than the single block, and scales with its casing material."
				""
				"&7Bronze, then steel, then titanium, then tungsten steel - each one roughly doubles output. The bronze one alone will comfortably run your whole steam age.&r"
				""
				"&c&lStill needs water.&r Multiblock boilers explode just as thoroughly as single ones, only louder.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:bronze_large_boiler"
			id: "11F76D9C6ABB1B01"
			rewards: [{
				id: "17B92B4C82613246"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Steam at scale"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6F7A8EB696070A1D"
				item: "gtceu:bronze_large_boiler"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&6Large Boilers"
			x: -12.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1B1DFBFE8EBD4D7D"]
			description: [
				"&eArc Furnace&r burns things with electricity and oxygen. &eExtruder&r pushes metal through a shaped mould."
				""
				"&7The Arc Furnace is the fastest recycler in the mod - feed it anything metal and get dust back. The Extruder makes rods, plates, wire, gears and pipes from ingots in one step.&r"
				""
				"&e&lThe Extruder needs a Programmed Circuit&r to choose which shape you meant. See the mechanics quest if that sentence is new.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_arc_furnace"
			id: "3D119F750AEDC6B5"
			rewards: [{
				id: "440CE2FD802D8DD6"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Recycle and extrude"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "1E7DEE89BB5C4C0C"
					item: "gtceu:lv_arc_furnace"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "6F264B64F2ADBC36"
					item: "gtceu:lv_extruder"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "&6Arc Furnace"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Two machines that only matter for circuits - and circuits are everything."
				""
				"&e&lAutoclave&r grows crystals from dust in a pressurised fluid. &e&lLaser Engraver&r etches patterns into wafers and plates."
				""
				"&7Together they are the silicon line: boule, wafer, engraved wafer, chip. Every circuit above MV comes out of these two machines.&r"
				""
				"&8Build them early even though they look niche. They stop looking niche immediately.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_laser_engraver"
			id: "674AF2EA7AAFFF11"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2A61B6FF22C86FC6"
