		{
			dependencies: ["6ABE982B094D119A"]
			description: [
				"&eFermenter&r turns biomass into ethanol. &eBrewery&r makes potions and useful fluids. &eCanner&r fills and empties containers."
				""
				"&7Ethanol is a genuinely good early fuel and your Mystical Agriculture farms produce biomass faster than you can burn it.&r"
				""
				"&8The Canner is the unglamorous one you will use constantly - filling cells is a step in an enormous number of recipes.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_fermenter"
