			x: -4.5d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["35C0E27B8CC84BB1"]
			description: [
				"Pumps fluid veins out of the ground - oil, natural gas, brine, lava."
				""
				"&c&lOn a void skyblock there are no fluid veins&r, so this is here for completeness rather than use. Your oil comes from PneumaticCraft and your distillation tower."
				""
				"&8If you ever build a platform over a real dimension with worldgen, this becomes the best oil source in the pack.&r"
