		{
			dependencies: ["35C0E27B8CC84BB1"]
			description: [
				"A multiblock turbine with a &eturbine rotor&r in the middle. Feed it steam and it produces a great deal of power."
				""
				"&7Rotor material sets efficiency and durability - bronze is poor, steel decent, titanium good, tungsten steel excellent. Rotors wear out and need replacing.&r"
				""
				"&e&lGas and Plasma turbines&r follow the same pattern with better fuels. The plasma turbine is an endgame generator.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:steam_large_turbine"
