				}
			]
			title: "&6Large Turbines"
			x: 3.0d
			y: 1.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"The second large boiler tier, and the one that will actually keep a large turbine fed."
				""
				"&7Roughly double the bronze boiler's steam output. Pair it with a Large Steam Turbine and you have a power plant.&r"
