		{
			description: [
				"Enormous automated mining multiblocks."
				""
				"&c&lAgain: there is nothing under your island to mine.&r These are included because the chapter is a complete voltage ladder, not because a skyblock can use them."
				""
				"&7Your ore comes from the sieve and always will. That is the trade this pack makes.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:ev_large_miner"
			id: "2071FD6F804BE5C4"
