			title: "&6EV Components"
			x: 10.5d
			y: 0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3F6135F92C4113A7"]
			description: [
				"&6&lThe Assembly Line does not know how to build anything until you teach it.&r"
				""
				"&e&l1.&r Put the target item and a blank &eData Stick&r in a &eScanner&r. It writes the research onto the stick."
				"&e&l2.&r Put the stick in a &eData Access Hatch&r on the Assembly Line."
				"&e&l3.&r The line can now build that item, and only that item."
				""
				"&7Every assembly line recipe needs its own stick. A hatch holds several; larger hatches hold more.&r"
				""
				"&8This is the mechanic that makes late GregTech feel like running a factory rather than crafting items.&r"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:data_stick"
			id: "02E443A12BE5D631"
			rewards: [{
				id: "1FFD18C55D71E5FF"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 80
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Research before manufacture"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "13B887D1A5AE1E03"
					item: "gtceu:lv_scanner"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 2L
					id: "1CC061A818E8FDB5"
					item: "gtceu:data_stick"
					type: "item"
