		}
		{
			description: [
				"&7ZPM, UV, UHV and the Fusion Reactor are all in this mod and none of them are in this chapter."
				""
				"&e&lWhat comes next, if you want it:&r fusion reactors that make plasma, plasma turbines that burn it, superconductors that move power without loss, and wetware circuits grown from cultured brain tissue."
				""
				"&7There are no quests for any of it. At this point you know how GregTech works well enough not to need them - which is the only sensible place for a quest chapter to stop.&r"
				""
